{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend","id":1002819,"title":"Advice for novice dreamspeaker/spirit girlfriend!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-14T03:48:40-08:00","id":1002819,"title":"Advice for novice dreamspeaker/spirit girlfriend!","content":"Guys i was finally able to persuade my girlfriend to play some rpg and she chose mage the ascension among all the settings! I used a coincidental mind persuasion effect that got an exceptional success. <br /> <br /> Now I was looking through the spirit and umbra section since she said that spirits and the spirit world really fascinate her and she would like to play a mage with the spirit sphere.<br /> I couldn't find a clear answer on these questions:<br /> <br /> 1- can a spirit use his influences and charms across the gauntlet on the physical world? Like can a fire spirit use blast and set things on fire in the &quot;physical reality&quot; of the players? (Granted he has the peek charm and can see the material world)- if not, can he uses his charms if he apply the materialized charm or cross the gauntlet, or possess a victim?<br /> <br /> 2 -can a spirit mage exchange quintessence with the spirit and feed him? Without using prime?<br /> <br /> 3-a mage with spirit can affect the other side of the gauntlet.... does this mean that I can cross over and then cast a lighting bolt across.the gauntlet and don't suffer the paradox? (Since there usually is no paradox in the umbra world). <br /> <br /> So far my girl has made her character sheet and I'm planning on making her play out her awakening and avatar discovery! I'll keep I guys updated if u want (I'm so happy.about this u have no idea... I guess people who have partners here who don't roleplay know the suffering of having to justify your nerd side to your fiancee &quot;: D )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4247,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","user":"Lasombra","date":". 11-14-2016, 01:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","name":"Lasombra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T10:38:19-08:00","id":1002950,"title":"","content":"1- yes, charms can be played over the gauntlet, though the gauntlet rating will have an affect on how difficult it is for the spirit's charms to take effect. Materialisation will allow the spirit to attack physically and be harmed physically.<br /> <br /> 2- you need Prime 3 Spirit 2 to pass quintessence to a spirit.<br /> <br /> 3- it's true that most effects in the penumbra are coincidental, but opening a hole in the gauntlet may still be vulgar enough for a paradox backlash to occur, especially in places where the gauntlet is high.<br /> <br /> Also, the Avatar Storm may be a thing that discourages that.<br /> <br /> I'm glad you managed to inspire her with this game, and I hope you guys get a lot of enjoyment out of it.<br /> <br /> I reccomend looking the the Book of Worlds and the Infinite Tapestry for some cool Umbral locations. The Velevet Shadow is also good for that, as is Wraith The Oblivion for all things dead lands.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T13:57:04-08:00","id":1003047,"title":"","content":"3 - Paradox is determined by the Vulgarity of something in the place it affects. Even if you cast from the Umbra, a Sanctum, or a different Reality Zone, it's still Vulgar. This is to stop players from side-stepping Paradox to a game-breaking level.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T14:04:28-08:00","id":1003048,"title":"","content":"Is it bad that I pictured a Dreamspeaker having a girlfriend that was a spirit? Given Spirits general Chthulhu-esque bizarre-ness, I found the image amusing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T14:20:35-08:00","id":1003062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend?p=1003048#post1003048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it bad that I pictured a Dreamspeaker having a girlfriend that was a spirit? Given Spirits general Chthulhu-esque bizarre-ness, I found the image amusing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Literally the first thing in my mind as well. Wouldn't be the first time I'd heard of such a thing, though.<br /> <br /> Freaking gamers, man.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T16:57:10-08:00","id":1003142,"title":"","content":"First off, thank you so much for ur answers guys . And yes the idea of a spirit girlfriend for a dreamspeaker is pretty creepy and awesome at.the same time. <br /> Game wise, when a spirit uses his charms across the gauntlet, do I have to roll against a difficulty equal to the gauntlet rating? <br /> If so, where do I find the reference for that?<br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks for the clarification on the paradox across dimensions it really makes sense and I will apply it no matter how far u run paradox will come your way to catch you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","name":"Lasombra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T00:22:01-08:00","id":1003267,"title":"","content":"Depending on where you are in the Umbra, paradox may bite you in particular ways, being in the shadowlands may lead to a spectre attack, while being in the dream worlds may result in the character's nightmares manifesting. It's only by going beyond the horizon (past mars) that paradox stops being a thing entirely.<br /> <br /> The chart for the Gauntlet rating will be in the book. You'll need extra successes to step sideways with anything more than just your body, including clothes, weapons, bags, etc, unless you consecrate them with Prime 1. Most Verbena get around this by going into the umbra skyclad.<br /> Also, look into totems, they can be quite an cool thing for the Dreamspeakers to have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 11-19-2016, 04:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T01:00:38-08:00","id":1005274,"title":"","content":"One more silly question.. since I come from werewolf the forsaken and mahe the awakening. - do spirits here feed on their concept or essence /resonance? Like a fire spirit could become an ally if the mage keeps offering him burnt sacrifices or if he set things on fire as part of rituals? Or a spirit of electricity could be offered Battery and generators, a storm spirit the aid in creating storms through forces, a crow spirit could respect a mage if he helps protecting crows in the city... etc... ? Is this how it works?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4247-lasombra","name":"Lasombra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T01:24:10-08:00","id":1005276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lasombra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend?p=1005274#post1005274\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One more silly question.. since I come from werewolf the forsaken and mahe the awakening. - do spirits here feed on their concept or essence /resonance? Like a fire spirit could become an ally if the mage keeps offering him burnt sacrifices or if he set things on fire as part of rituals? Or a spirit of electricity could be offered Battery and generators, a storm spirit the aid in creating storms through forces, a crow spirit could respect a mage if he helps protecting crows in the city... etc... ? Is this how it works?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, you nailed it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T01:30:48-08:00","id":1005277,"title":"","content":"It can totally work that way.<br /> There's a whole system of chiminage in WtA which is detailed properly in Axis Mundi.<br /> I don't know how spirits work in Forsaken, but in oWoD, their essence/power is basically quintessence, and the way most can recharge is by absorbing more, either from another werewolf, a mage who gives them Quint, or from going into Slumber for a number of hours.<br /> <br /> But to me it makes perfect sense that a fire elemental would get stronger if there was a fire for it to feed off.<br /> <br /> All spirits want something, an the Axis Mundi details a lot both the material components and acts of Chiminage which will endear you to the spirit in question.<br /> <br /> For example, Raven spirits are pranksters who enjoy riddles, so they'll appreciate a quick game of riddles for small favour, or a pretty good prank on their enemies for larger ones. They especially like the kind of pranks which trick Banes into helping Gaia, for example.<br /> A Rat spirit, on the other hand, would be content with having a place to stay and a good supply of food. If you are known to attack rats, however, they will probably be quite hostile.<br /> <br /> Spirits talk, and there is near constant rivalry between the various broods.<br /> <br /> As this is Mage, you aren't limited to Werewolf spirits, you can incorporate spirits from all kinds of sources, any books you like or you know she likes, or even make a few up.<br /> For example, mages deal with angels, ancestral spirits, dreams, demons, abstract concepts, and even archetypes like Death.<br /> Choose a mythology and feel free to transplant its spirits wholesale.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 11-19-2016, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T13:32:04-08:00","id":1005457,"title":"","content":"I always wondered what it would be like for a mage who makes alliances with Paradox spirits?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T13:39:40-08:00","id":1005461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend?p=1005457#post1005457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I always wondered what it would be like for a mage who makes alliances with Paradox spirits?</div> </div> </div> </div>In a word, constraining. They'd have to do a lot of work to keep up that relationship, and not do anything to piss them off.<br /> <br /> Imagine having a paradox spirit keep their eye on you for signs of messing up reality 24/7.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-19T13:41:08-08:00","id":1005462,"title":"","content":"Seems like day to day life in the technocratic union.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-30T03:12:44-08:00","id":1010125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lasombra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend#post1002819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2 -can a spirit mage exchange quintessence with the spirit and feed him? Without using prime?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not noramlly, but I think it's possible if spirit is your familiar. Plus you can always offer Tass. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1002819-advice-for-novice-dreamspeaker-spirit-girlfriend?p=1003048#post1003048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it bad that I pictured a Dreamspeaker having a girlfriend that was a spirit? Given Spirits general Chthulhu-esque bizarre-ness, I found the image amusing.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's actually pretty common. some totems demand to marry their mage, with ceremony and everything. Couple can even make little spirit babies in Umbra. Of course jealaus totem is a completely different bag of snakes. Some supplement also mentions that you can take familiar as a lover. <br /> <br /> Not to mention the long time tradition of summoning succubi and similar beings. If you want really hardcore, there is Nephilim merit (7pt.) that lets you play half human - half something, commonly from Astral.<br /> Additionally, there was a merit in one of the middle ages/naphandi books that has merit for half-demon children. That's for when your parents had sex while possessed. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4340-warpwind","name":"Warpwind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4340_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}